          "description": "Participants received pembrolizumab 200 mg via IV infusion on Day 1 of each 21-day cycle for up to 35 cycles (up to approximately 2 years) PLUS placebo for lenvatinib via oral capsule QD until PD or discontinuation. With protocol amendment 3 (effective: Sep-24-2021), participants discontinued placebo.\n\nAt the investigator's discretion, eligible participants randomized to the pembrolizumab + placebo arm who completed the first course of pembrolizumab, or who had stopped pembrolizumab due to confirmed CR, initiated a second course of pembrolizumab (200 mg IV infusion on Day 1 of each 21-day cycle, for up to 17 cycles \\[up to approximately 1 additional year\\]) upon experiencing PD.",
